-QoeleLQ&oe=6ADCAF24"}, {"file_name": "2025_07_07T15_06_19_000Z.png", "id": "670356436054441", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819980_670356439387774_4480627947701134011_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O5m5hQrbILoQ7kNvwEivSwx&_nc_oc=AdqIyjsjckycvmxIMLr63B39M4C0xDJQykl8lFFf-1k6ia9zsQeDMURzhZVGoDCRfa4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9C2iAZ781Stah2Hx5NDVjyFgZ_T0jtKxHGkBO5aJ8PA&oe=6ADCB654"}, {"file_name": "2025_06_23T13_08_27_000Z.png", "id": "1233633374908304", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819464_1233633378241637_4357898010728101939_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JIY-x1Y-TRcQ7kNvwHOu6GA&_nc_oc=AdqQuaWtLS3kZQyX1tjF7cPOa13OUsse7Fp9XeSH2Vwvmxd-6pFWz72lyOnrxGV8nIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPXoiYDc6lxeXZ8U3-Z5Y8en1Q5fg2Ovr7sdpNFkkklJw&oe=6ADCD696"}, {"file_name": "516029787_24009120252085746_6221000728869061665_n.png", "id": "24054967467467496", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_24054967474134162_2024737833819561677_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cNJFVHa3B4sQ7kNvwE-pOOr&_nc_oc=AdoN9xDIQQ_sGe4cNqOep8ftE5ZBz1L9SeavQQqheMnlaMpVaXYcm5XPGMz5ejOxaZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMA8V8-24VsV6TpYozVxhYzKngZilPXFwx9C-lAqWxM_Q&oe=6ADCB6F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover2560x1440wLogo.png", "id": "1766509417233975", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299795_1766509420567308_4385946516626495694_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m2x9SKphwIUQ7kNvwGd9pw6&_nc_oc=AdprIUEm4Jd-aFWG1lGKqeOLkkXn6YsWdFJOLEn-pK-IpGDqZPZiWM7ApHVZxlQ5LnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMp5BpTJaqeGSAF-GkSy8aETE4utqXvcZ-cFAPmJaM-Dg&oe=6ADCA259"}, "display_name": "Traffic Racer VR", "keywords": ["traffic", "racer", "cars", "racing", "drive"], "long_description": "Welcome to Traffic Racer VR \u2013 the ultimate adrenaline-fueled driving experience built from the ground up for virtual reality!\n\nPut yourself in the driver\u2019s seat and experience the thrill of racing through dense traffic at high speed. With ultra-immersive VR controls and realistic physics, every turn, swerve, and near-miss feels dangerously real. Dodge cars, weave between lanes, and master the flow of traffic as you chase high scores and big rewards.\n\nUnlock a growing collection of high-performance cars . From sleek sports cars to powerful muscle machines, your garage is your trophy cabinet.\n\nFeeling competitive? Traffic Racer VR features Daily and Weekly leaderboards where you can battle players around the world for the top spot. Push your limits, climb the ranks, and show everyone who the true king of the road is.\n\nWith fast-paced gameplay, stunning visuals, and a true-to-life driving sensation, Traffic Racer VR delivers a racing experience that\u2019s only possible in VR.\n\nWhether you're chasing the next car unlock, perfecting your skills, or gunning for leaderboard glory, Traffic Racer VR will keep your heart pounding and your headset on.\n\nReady to race? ", "short_description": "Race through traffic like never before in Traffic Racer VR! Feel the speed in full virtual reality as you weave between cars, unlock high-performance vehicles, and climb the Daily and Weekly leaderboards. Every race is a thrill \u2014 can you handle the pressure and become #1? With realistic driving physics and heart-pounding gameplay, this is the ultimate VR racer. Strap in, hit the gas, and own the road!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/ef0cca47-9ac1-4bd5-9f0e-4b192f4173e2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Banana", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://linktr.ee/banana_meta", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MO